        "title": "Parametri",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147992,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A volte le funzioni hanno bisogno di informazioni specifiche per svolgere le loro attività. Come una funzione che aggiunge un oggetto all'inventario di un giocatore.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    height: 350px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #0B1020;&#xA;    color: #E6E6E6;&#xA;    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;   }&#xA;   button {&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    font-size: 18px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;    color: black;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;   }&#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   #inventoryList {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    width: 280px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;   }&#xA;   input {&#xA;    width: 260px;&#xA;    height: 28px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Pick Up Loot&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&quot;Loot&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;itemInput&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input id=&quot;iInput&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; placeholder=&quot;Enter an item (e.g., Potion)&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;button onClick=&quot;pickUp()&quot;&gt;Pick Up&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;Inventory&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul id=&quot;inventoryList&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;full&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let slotsUsed = 0;&#xA;   function pickUp() {&#xA;    if (slotsUsed &gt;= 3) {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;full&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;Inventory Full&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     const item = document.getElementById(&quot;iInput&quot;).value;&#xA;     let node = document.createElement(&quot;P&quot;);&#xA;     const textnode = document.createTextNode(&quot;Picked up: &quot; + item);&#xA;     node.appendChild(textnode);&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;inventoryList&quot;).appendChild(node);&#xA;     slotsUsed++;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147993,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per iniziare, possiamo usare le costanti all'interno delle funzioni. Ad esempio, creando <code> const item = \"Potion\";</code> e usandola nell'istruzione di visualizzazione.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUpPotion\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUpPotion();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>item</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>\"Potion\"</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come potremmo raccogliere un altro oggetto? Potremmo creare e chiamare una nuova funzione <code>pickUpKey();</code> con codice simile.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"187\" endIndex=\"198\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUpPotion\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUpPotion();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUpKey\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUpKey();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>pickUpKey()</code>, seguito da <code>pickUpKey()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147995,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invece di scrivere due funzioni, possiamo passare informazioni specifiche a una sola funzione, senza ripetere il codice. Ecco una breve panoramica.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUp(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUp(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"</code>, seguito da <code>Key</code> e infine <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147996,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per passare un valore a una funzione, aggiungiamo prima una variabile chiamata <strong>parametro</strong> all'interno delle parentesi della funzione. Qui passeremo <code>item</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pickUp\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>item</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147997,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il parametro funziona come una variabile che memorizza un valore. Tuttavia, per ora non contiene ancora alcun valore.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"57\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>item</code>, seguito da <code>item</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147998,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per passare un valore alla variabile, lo inseriamo tra parentesi quando chiamiamo la funzione, come qui con <code>pickUp(\"Gem\");</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUp(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>pickUp</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>\"Gem\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147999,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si usano le variabili all'interno delle funzioni?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Usiamo le variabili normalmente all'interno delle funzioni</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo creare nuove variabili nelle funzioni</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Usiamo le variabili normalmente all'interno delle funzioni.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148000,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché non vogliamo molto codice che svolge attività simili?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Perché significa duplicare lo stesso codice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché avremo molte funzioni</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché significa duplicare lo stesso codice.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148001,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché passiamo informazioni specifiche alle funzioni?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per evitare di scrivere funzioni aggiuntive e duplicare il codice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per poter chiamare una funzione</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per evitare di scrivere funzioni aggiuntive e duplicare il codice.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148002,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dove vanno i parametri?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I parametri vanno inseriti tra le parentesi della funzione che stiamo creando</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">I parametri vanno inseriti solo nelle istruzioni <code>console.log()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I parametri vanno inseriti tra le parentesi della funzione che stiamo creando.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148003,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa serve un parametro?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Funziona come una variabile speciale che memorizza un valore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Rende più facile duplicare il codice</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Funziona come una variabile speciale che memorizza un valore.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148004,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come passiamo un valore per il parametro alla funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Chiamiamo la funzione con il valore tra parentesi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Chiamiamo la funzione e inseriamo direttamente dopo il valore </item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Chiamiamo la funzione con il valore tra parentesi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148005,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea la costante da usare all'interno della funzione.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showHealth\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player Health: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + health);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showHealth();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>health</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148006,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa l'istruzione display.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"gameState\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playing = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" paused = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;State: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + paused);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"gameState();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>console</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>log</code>, <code>paused</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 148007,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi il parametro <code>state</code> alla funzione.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"24\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"gameState\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"state\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;State: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + state);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"gameState(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>state</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 148008,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi il nome della funzione <code>addScoreBonus</code> e il parametro <code>score</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addScoreBonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bonus = score / \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bonus);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"addScoreBonus(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>addScoreBonus</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>score</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 148009,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione <code>spawnEnemies()</code> e passa il valore <code>5</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"96\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemies\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"count\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = count * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"spawnEnemies(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>spawnEnemies</code>, seguito da <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
